flowchart LR
    subgraph Input
        O[Owner: pets + tasks<br/>pawpal_system.py]
    end

    subgraph Knowledge["Knowledge base (offline)"]
        K[(knowledge/*.md<br/>Chester profile + general dog/cat docs)]
        X[Indexer: chunk by section<br/>TF-IDF via scikit-learn]
        K --> X
    end

    O --> S[Scheduler.build_daily_plan]
    S -->|per task: pet profile + task words| A[GuidanceAdvisor]
    A -->|query + species / life-stage / pet filters| R[Retriever: top-k chunks + score]
    X --> R
    R --> A

    A --> G1{Emergency wording?}
    G1 -- yes --> U[Urgent: contact a vet now]
    G1 -- no --> G2{Top score >= threshold?}
    G2 -- no --> F[Fallback: ask your vet]
    G2 -- yes --> P[Cited guidance, duration warnings,<br/>medication reminder]

    U --> D[DailyPlan: reasons + sources + confidence]
    F --> D
    P --> D
    A -->|missing-task proposals| SG[Suggestions]
    SG --> H{Human review:<br/>owner approves?}
    H -- yes --> AC[accept_suggestion: conflict-free slot]
    AC --> S
    D --> H2[Owner reads plan in CLI / Streamlit]

    A -.-> L[(logs/pawpal_rag.log)]
    R -.-> L

    T[Tests + eval_harness.py<br/>12 preset cases, pass/fail + confidence] -.checks.-> A
    T -.checks.-> D
